WEBVTT

00:00:00.744 --> 00:00:01.500
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.415 --> 00:00:06.251
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> It was the <b>recession</b> and it was very difficult to get a job.

00:00:08.214 --> 00:00:08.931
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.851 --> 00:00:12.166
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I <b>applied for</b> lots of different jobs.

00:00:14.093 --> 00:00:14.916
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:15.871 --> 00:00:19.537
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We <b>got cut off</b> because the bus went into a tunnel.

00:00:21.565 --> 00:00:22.365
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:23.297 --> 00:00:28.588
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I was interested in <b>either</b> a trip to see birds <b>or</b> a trip to see a tiger.

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:31.505
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:32.427 --> 00:00:36.001
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I thought it would be really cool to see a tiger <b>in the wild</b>.

00:00:37.906 --> 00:00:38.765
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:39.656 --> 00:00:42.593
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> We spent <b>the whole</b> morning looking for the tiger.